* FGFET vertical access transistor (VFET) - BSIM4 (level 54)

* VFET of the FGFET (Kim et al., IEEE Access 2023): vertical pillar access transistor.
* Generated by scripts/fit_vfet.py from PTM 32nm HP + Table I geometry + fit to Fig. 2(b),(d).
* Use L = 100.2n; W/L = 1u/100.2n reproduces the per-um curves of Fig. 2.
* Si3N4 S/D barrier transport is lumped into u0 / rdsw / vsat; junctions and GIDL disabled.
